# A root commit whose file list errors prints without it, with a note.
args: show example.com/handwritten/root-error-free@v1.0.0
exit: 0
--- stdout
example.com/handwritten/root-error-free@9f2c1d3e5a7b  2020-05-04  Ada Lovelace  parents none  rev v1.0.0
    Start the project

    The first commit.
--- stderr
sego: note: root commit: Sourcegraph has no diff for it
